# =============================================================
#  ControlEasy — .gitignore (composite for C# / Angular / Docker)
# =============================================================

# -------- Visual Studio / .NET / Rider --------
# Source: https://github.com/github/gitignore (VisualStudio.gitignore)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
# `Lib/` is the Visual Studio convention for C++ project outputs. The original
# template uses `[Ll]ib/` which matches at any depth and therefore also matches
# our vendored C# source under src/lib/DBTools_SQL/. Anchor to repo root and
# re-include the vendor below.
/[Ll]ib/
/[Ll]ib64/
[Oo]ut/
[Oo]bj/
.vs/
.vscode/
# Allow vendored DBTools_SQL source (src/lib/DBTools_SQL/ is a C# project, not
# a VS C++ Lib/ output). Build artifacts inside the vendor are still ignored
# via [Bb]in/, [Oo]bj/ at the top of this file.
!/src/lib/
!/src/lib/**
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.sln.docstates
*.userosscache
*.sln.ide
*.swp
*.tmp
*.cache
*.dbmdl
*.dbproj.schemaview
*.jfm
*.pfx
*.publishsettings
